# Cloudflare Pages custom headers. Not served itself; Pages parses it and applies
# these to every static asset response. Wrangler/Pages Functions do NOT get them,
# so keep this site static.
#
# Cross-origin isolation is not optional here. The kirikiri and Play! runtimes are
# built with pthreads, and a browser only offers SharedArrayBuffer - which those
# threads need - on a cross-origin-isolated page.
#
# require-corp is safe because the site fetches nothing cross-origin. If that ever
# changes, the cross-origin response needs a Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy header of
# its own (or a passing CORS check) or it will be blocked.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
